  "rationale": "Every non-foothold step except the target is reachable. The target is an OR with four independent routes. (1) vaultRead comes from secretsManager, which needs monitoringHost and fileServer (via ssoLogin). (2) shareMount comes from backupHost, which needs dbLogin or browserStore. browserStore is reachable through iotDevice from the internet or exposedApi footholds. (3) and (4) dbReplica and codeRepo come from serviceAccount, which needs ssoLogin and vpnSession. The only steps that cut the shareMount route are shareMount and backupHost, and blocking either leaves vaultRead, dbReplica and codeRepo reachable. No single step is shared by all four routes, so no step on its own makes the target unreachable."
